<item><title>Guinea invites investors into a diversified economy at Simandou summit</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-invites-investors-into-a-diversified-economy-at-ad6d63/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-invites-investors-into-a-diversified-economy-at-ad6d63/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The Simandou Mining Summit opened on Kassa Island on 11 November 2026 with a call for investors to help turn mineral wealth into growth in several sectors.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:32:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea seeks $693 million for Conakry urban rail link</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-seeks-693-million-for-conakry-urban-rail-link-8f425c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-seeks-693-million-for-conakry-urban-rail-link-8f425c/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The transport ministry presented the heavy rail plan, with an estimated investment cost of 693 million dollars, to investors at the Simandou Mining Summit.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:23:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
